<< /A 861 0 R /ActualText (Diagram comparing different neural network architectures with encoders and decoders, including UNet, ESPNet, SwinUNet, TransUNet, CTC - Net, CoTr, TransFuse, HiFormer, and Ours. Each uses CNN, Transformer components, feature fusion, and connections to illustrate their unique structures and data flow paths.\r\n) /Alt (Diagram comparing different neural network architectures with encoders and decoders, including UNet, ESPNet, SwinUNet, TransUNet, CTC - Net, CoTr, TransFuse, HiFormer, and Ours. Each uses CNN, Transformer components, feature fusion, and connections to illustrate their unique structures and data flow paths.\r\n) /K 0 /P 104 0 R /Pg 233 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
