<< /A 865 0 R /ActualText (Flowchart illustrating a neural network. Inputs \\\(X_1\\\), \\\(X_2\\\), \\\(X_3\\\) undergo pointwise convolution \(PWConv\), followed by concatenation and upsampling. Processed through two convolutional blocks, each defined by parameters \\\(\(I, O, K\)\\\), then a final PWConv. Output goes through a sigmoid activation function. Batch size, channels, height, and width notation \\\(\(B, C, H, W\)\\\) is explained. PWConv is clarified as pointwise convolution, and upsampling and sigmoid function are denoted by symbols.\r\n) /Alt (Flowchart illustrating a neural network. Inputs \\\(X_1\\\), \\\(X_2\\\), \\\(X_3\\\) undergo pointwise convolution \(PWConv\), followed by concatenation and upsampling. Processed through two convolutional blocks, each defined by parameters \\\(\(I, O, K\)\\\), then a final PWConv. Output goes through a sigmoid activation function. Batch size, channels, height, and width notation \\\(\(B, C, H, W\)\\\) is explained. PWConv is clarified as pointwise convolution, and upsampling and sigmoid function are denoted by symbols.\r\n) /K 2 /P 104 0 R /Pg 236 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
